[{"answer":"Hello Charlotte.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/1_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm Kaeden, one of the supervisors.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/2_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Welcome to the team.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/3_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi Aiden.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/4_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's Kaeden.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/5_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm so sorry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/6_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't worry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/7_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"People often get my name wrong;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/8_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"they never know how to spell it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/9_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's KAEDEN, in case you ever need to write it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/10_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll try and remember.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/11_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So, there are a few practical things you need to sort out this morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/12_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Then I'll show you what you're going to do today.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/13_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... the email I received said to go to the front desk, to show my letter of appointment and pick up my badge.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/14-2024-10-10-22-14-30.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll need that for the staffroom and other areas of the supermarket where shoppers aren't allowed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/15_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So, after you've finished at the front desk, I'll take you to the staffroom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/16_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Put your coat and rucksack in one of the lockers there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/17_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Take whichever one is free.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/18_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Will I have a key?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/19_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. Try not to lose it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/20_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"At the end of the day, leave it in the door for the next person to use.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/21_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Will do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/22_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You also need to go to the HR department to see Tiffany.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/23_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"She's really helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/24_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I was told to bring my passport with me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/25_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"HR need to take a note of the number in it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/26_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/27_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Or you can show your ID card.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/28_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't have one of those.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/29_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. Tiffany will give you a uniform.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/30_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... They have lots in different sizes, so you just tell her what you need.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/31_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I won't come with you to HR. I've got to go and sort something else out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/32_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Uhm... problem with a bread slicer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/33_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Is the HR office near the staffroom?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/34_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The staffroom's on the first floor, and HR are a couple of floors above that, on the third floor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/35_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a staircase outside the staffroom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/36_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/37_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"When you've finished with HR, come and find me in the bakery section of the shop.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/38_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm looking forward to getting started.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/39_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll just give you my phone number, in case you can't find me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/40_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... have you got your phone there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/41_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes... Okay, ready.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/42_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 0412665903.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/43_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, done.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/44_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So, Charlotte, your tasks today are in the bakery section,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/45_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"on the sushi counter, and on the meat and fish counters.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/46_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The first job is to check sell-by dates on the bread and cakes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/47_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"If any of the dates are today's, put a new price label on the packaging.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/48_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"What if any of the labels are yesterday's dates, or older?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/49_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Do I throw those items away?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/50_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but that shouldn't happen, we check the stock every day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/51_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"When something needs a new price label,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/52_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"put a yellow one on the package, next to the original price.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/53_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/54_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"After that, you'll go to the sushi takeaway counter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/55_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Will I be preparing boxes of food?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/56_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... for today, you'll just be helping the staff.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/57_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/58_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll see lots of flat cardboard boxes at one end of the counter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/59_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Beneath those is where we keep the plastic boxes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/60_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"we run out of those really quickly, so you should bring more from the storeroom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/61_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that my only task on the sushi counter?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/62_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"No. You also need to clean the area where they prepare the dishes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/63_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"There are cloths and bottles of spray by the sink.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/64_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and please make sure you clean that too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/65_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure. That's important, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/66_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Absolutely. But you mustn't wash up knives.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/67_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You have to do some training before you're allowed to touch sharp objects.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/68_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"What should I do if there are any?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/69_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Ask someone to put them in the dishwasher.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/70_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/71_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't want to get anything wrong.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/72_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't worry. You'll be fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/73_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And I'll be around to help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/74_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/75_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Finally, the meat and fish counters.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/76_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You need to clean the area where staff serve customers,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/77_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"including wiping the weighing scales.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/78_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/79_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/80_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The fish is laid on ice, but when that starts to melt, you'll need to get more from the cold-room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/81_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I know the staff on the food counters wear a hat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/82_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Will that be the same for me?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/83_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You won't be serving customers directly, so no.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/84_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"But make sure you put on thermal gloves when you take anything out of the cold-room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/85_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The temperature's low enough in there to get frostbite from touching things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/86_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Understood.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-4-part-1-2024-06-24-00-31-45/87_v3.mp3"}]
